# Test artifacts
# `npm run test:coverage` (TRD §9.1) writes the v8 text/json/html reporters
# here. Without this entry the plan's own coverage command leaves a dozen
# untracked files in the repository root, and the Day 16 coverage gate — the
# first task that runs it routinely — is when they get committed.
coverage/

